// cabacWriter/encodeResidual CABAC bitstream plus the exact input plane,
// prediction-only plane (cbf=false) and fully reconstructed plane (cbf=true).
// The MoonBit port must reproduce them sample for sample.

///|
/// One reconstructPlane case. `bytes` is the CABAC substream; `coef` are
/// the levels the upstream encoder wrote (for reference); `pred_plane` is
/// the plane after intra prediction with cbf=false; `plane_out` is the full
/// reconstruction with cbf=true (dequant -> inverse transform -> add).
